          <p class="eyebrow">10 / COMPLETE TECHNICAL COMPANION</p>
          <h2>架构全貌与生产级技术手册。</h2>
          <p>白皮书 8 个核心章节与 56 个工业级技术主题在此建立完整规范索引。涵盖业务痛点、内核解耦、状态机拓扑、9 条业务链流水线、16 角色沙箱、分层门禁与生产就绪复盘，提供严密的工程逻辑递进与实现细节。</p>
        </div>
        <a class="button quiet" href="/projects/county-agent/whitepaper.md" download>下载架构白皮书全文 ↓</a>
      </div>

      <div class="handbook-roadmap-card">
        <div class="roadmap-card-header">
          <span class="micro-label">SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE BLUEPRINT</span>
          <h3>白皮书技术架构八阶递进脉络</h3>
          <p>从业务痛点推导内核分层，从数据底座串联业务流水线，再到沙箱隔离、质量防线与生产验收，形成逻辑闭环。点击卡片可快速聚焦对应章节：</p>
        </div>
        <div class="roadmap-grid">
          {handbookStages.map(stage => (
            <button type="button" class="roadmap-node" data-handbook-jump={stage.chapter}>
              <div class="node-top">
                <span class="node-tag">{stage.tag}</span>
                <span class="node-arrow">↗</span>
              </div>
              <strong>{stage.title}</strong>
              <p>{stage.desc}</p>
            </button>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="handbook-toolbar">
        <label class="handbook-search">
          <span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span>
          <input id="handbook-search" type="search" placeholder="搜索主题、模块标签、工具或参数，例如 状态机、门禁、Reducer" aria-label="搜索全部技术主题" />
          <kbd>/</kbd>
        </label>
        <span id="handbook-count" role="status" aria-live="polite">{articles.length} 个技术主题</span>
        <button id="handbook-collapse" class="text-link">收起全部 −</button>
      </div>

      <div class="handbook-filters" aria-label="筛选技术章节">
        <button data-handbook-filter="all" class="selected" aria-pressed="true">全部 ({articles.length})</button>
        {chapterNames.map((name, i) => <button data-handbook-filter={i + 1} aria-pressed="false">{name}</button>)}
      </div>

      <div class="handbook-list">
        {articles.map(article => (
          <details class="handbook-topic" id={article.id} data-topic data-topic-chapter={article.chapter} data-search={article.search}>
            <summary>
              <div class="topic-leading">
                <span class="topic-number">{article.number.endsWith(".0") ? `${article.chapter} · 导言` : article.number}</span>
                <span class="topic-badge">{article.tag}</span>
              </div>
              <div class="topic-main">
                <div class="topic-submodule">{article.subModule}</div>
                <h3>{article.title}</h3>
                <p>{article.synopsis}</p>
              </div>
              <span class="topic-plus">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="topic-body">
              <div class="topic-source-label">
                <span>原文依据 / {article.number.endsWith(".0") ? `白皮书第 ${article.chapter} 章导言` : `白皮书 § ${article.number}`} · {article.sourceTitle}</span>
                <span>保留技术细节与规范定义，支持代码、公式与流程图核对</span>
              </div>
              <div class="technical-prose" set:html={article.html} />
            </div>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div id="handbook-empty" hidden>
        <strong>没有找到匹配主题</strong>
        <p>试试“状态机”“门禁”“沙箱”或“Reducer”，也可以点击上方章节切换。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="source-accounting"><strong>资料与展示口径</strong><p>本页依据项目架构白皮书与原项目记录重构。交互为架构教学演示；流程参数、评测目标和文档记录的样例成绩均按各自口径展示。源文中约 62% / 91% 通过率、4.8% 无效动作基线、70% 工具效率提升及 &gt;90% 缓存命中等描述，未附测试样本或原始日志，保留在技术手册供核对。</p><p>183 县 × 5 年对应 915 个“县—年”组合；9,150 单元的额外指标维度未在原文说明。角色口径统一为 16，试点交付阶段按白皮书统一为 12。</p></div>
      <div class="closing-note"><span class="micro-label">ENGINEERING REFLECTION</span><h3>最费力的部分，<br />往往发生在模型推理之前。</h3><p>清洗复杂报表，恢复文档层级，整理有噪音的纪要，让业务语言找到正确的数据表。底座越清楚，上层分析才越有依据。</p><div><a class="button primary" href="/projects/">返回项目集 ↗</a><a class="button quiet" href="#overview">回到顶部 ↑</a></div></div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <dialog id="county-diagram-dialog" aria-labelledby="county-diagram-title"><div class="diagram-dialog-heading"><div><span class="micro-label">INTERACTIVE CANVAS</span><h2 id="county-diagram-title">架构图</h2></div><button type="button" id="county-diagram-close" class="button quiet">关闭 ×</button></div><figure class="source-diagram"><div class="diagram-controls" aria-label="图示缩放"><button type="button" data-diagram-zoom="out" aria-label="缩小图示">−</button><span data-diagram-scale>100%</span><button type="button" data-diagram-zoom="in" aria-label="放大图示">+</button><button type="button" data-diagram-zoom="natural">原始尺寸</button><button type="button" data-diagram-zoom="reset">适配视图</button></div><div class="mermaid-host" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="图示画布，可拖动及滚动"><img id="county-dialog-diagram" alt="" /></div><figcaption>拖动画布查看细节 · 按 Esc 关闭</figcaption></figure></dialog>
  <dialog id="county-image-dialog" aria-label="项目截图查看器"><div class="image-dialog-toolbar"><button id="county-image-size" aria-pressed="false">原始尺寸</button><a id="county-image-original" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">打开原图 ↗</a><button id="county-image-close" aria-label="关闭项目截图">关闭 ×</button></div><div class="image-dialog-canvas"><img id="county-dialog-image" alt="" /></div><p id="county-dialog-caption"></p></dialog>
